<title>RUSSIA: Russia sees no Paris, London Club deal impact.</title>
<headline>Russia sees no Paris, London Club deal impact.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A decision by Ukraine's parliament to delay ratification of a treaty with Russia on former Soviet debt will not affect Russia's debt agreements with the London and Paris Clubs of commercial banks and government creditors, a senior Finance Ministry official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;This will have have no impact on our relations with the Paris or London Clubs,&quot; Deputy Finance Minister Mikhail Kasyanov told Reuters.</p>
</text>
